                                "example_id": "0774bfe0-e284-4260-a532-9a62e4fff691",
                                "sense_id": "ac4621ca-677e-318a-9312-eaadd268336d",
                                "text": "Still, Mr. Pylypchuk has fashioned an intricate crazy quilt from little more than old socks and flannels, picking through the ruins of a troubled American city while paying tribute to the scrappiness of its residents."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2d57a4cb-ea28-4195-8b39-fca2fe802c8e",
                                "sense_id": "ac4621ca-677e-318a-9312-eaadd268336d",
                                "text": "The decisive moment was entirely in keeping with a game that was thrilling in its scrappiness, a mess of a goal to settle a mess of a game. In fairness, it began with the first bit of subtlety Tottenham had shown around the box from Richarlison, who had not until that moment seemed likely to offer the moment of inspiration."
                            }
                        ]
